OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AIrish schools law blocked as unionists
OL,4,Adeploy Stormont veto
OL,5,
OL,6,FA majority of 43 to 30 assembly members
OL,7,Fbacked the legislation on Tuesday, but
OL,8,Fthe Democratic Unionist Party (DUP)
OL,9,Ftabled petition of concern meant the
OL,10,Flegislation required cross-community
OL,11,Fsupport in order to pass.
OL,13,FFirst Minister Michelle O'Neill said
OL,14,Fblocking the bill was "absolutely
OL,15,Fdisgraceful" and accused unionist
OL,16,Fparties of "anti-Irish bigotry".
